set unknown-geometry-of-the-deep
# The Geometry of the Deep: 48 x 28 tiles of 16 stage pixels.
# Made from the game's own layout by angel-delve world3d::blockout; written by the
# write_world3d_sets test (ANGEL_WORLD3D_SETS=1). Change the generator, not this file.
camera room 768 448
plate 1536 1024
# Torches flank every doorway; bars close them while the fight lasts (sprites).

# the ground: its top is the floor line
